1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,402
Zoom out, and the shape of the story is almost absurd.

2
00:00:03,402 --> 00:00:06,005
A debut that broke records without her.

3
00:00:06,005 --> 00:00:07,564
Four months of silence.

4
00:00:07,564 --> 00:00:09,639
A return that doubled the debut.

5
00:00:09,639 --> 00:00:12,822
A nickname she retired by becoming uncomparable.

6
00:00:12,822 --> 00:00:19,793
Records for views, votes, radio, and domes — most of them still marked fastest in history.

7
00:00:19,793 --> 00:00:22,113
All of it before her twentieth birthday.

